Content
-------

The MIT license covers the code. It doesn't cover the content below, which
isn't the author's to give; all rights stay with its owners.

- The name Markaryds Fågelklubb and the club's emblem, the dipper
  (src/assets/logo.webp, src/assets/icon-64.png,
  src/assets/apple-touch-icon.png, .github/readme/emblem.png), belong to
  Markaryds Fågelklubb.
- The club's texts, among them the app's privacy policy and terms of use in
  src/pages/om-foreningen/ and the lokal notes in scripts/lokal-points.sql,
  belong to Markaryds Fågelklubb.
- The photos on the site, most of them taken by members, belong to their
  photographers. They live in the club's database, not in this repository;
  the screenshots in .github/readme/ show some of them.
- The sponsors' logos in src/assets/sponsors/ belong to the sponsors.
- The App Store and Google Play badges (src/assets/app-store-badge.svg,
  src/assets/google-play-badge.png) are trademarks of Apple and Google.

src/data/markaryd-boundary.json is OpenStreetMap data, © OpenStreetMap
contributors, available under the Open Database License 1.0.
